---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const stack = [
  'React',
  'TypeScript',
  'Netlify Serverless Functions',
  'CQC API',
  'AI-drafted outreach',
];

const steps = [
  {
    title: 'Search any registered provider',
    body: 'Provider name search against the live CQC API. No more digging through the CQC website or stale spreadsheets.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Serverless proxy keeps credentials safe',
    body: 'Netlify functions hold the Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key and proxy requests, so the API key never ships to the browser.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Inspection data, structured for sellers',
    body: 'Ratings, inspection history, and service types are pulled into a view designed around what an SDR needs in the 30 seconds before a call.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Outreach Intelligence tab',
    body: 'Auto-drafts personalised outreach grounded in the provider’s actual inspection data, so the research is already in the first line of the email.',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="CQC Research Dashboard Case Study | Ishraq Alam"
  description="How a live CQC data dashboard cut care-provider research from minutes to seconds and became Nourish Care's proof-of-concept for AI-assisted prospecting."
>
  <article>
    <section class="cs-hero">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <a href="/case-studies/" class="back">← All case studies</a>
        <span class="eyebrow animate-fade-in-up">Case study · Shipped &amp; in use company-wide</span>
        <h1 class="animate-fade-in-up delay-1">CQC Research Dashboard</h1>
        <p class="lede animate-fade-in-up delay-2">
          A live dashboard on Care Quality Commission data that replaced slow,
          inconsistent manual research with instant, personalised outreach intelligence.
          It became Nourish Care's internal proof-of-concept for AI-assisted prospecting.
        </p>
        <ul class="chips animate-fade-in-up delay-3">
          {stack.map((item) => <li class="chip chip-blue">{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mockup-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="mockup animate-fade-in delay-4" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the CQC Research Dashboard interface">
          <div class="mockup-titlebar">
            <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
            <span class="mockup-title">CQC Research Dashboard</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-body">
            <div class="mockup-search">🔍 Search CQC-registered providers…</div>
            <div class="mockup-tabs">
              <span class="tab">Provider Profile</span>
              <span class="tab">Inspection History</span>
              <span class="tab active">Outreach Intelligence</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mockup-panel">
              <div class="mockup-row"><span class="label">Provider</span> Willow Grange Care Home · Residential</div>
              <div class="mockup-row"><span class="label">Latest rating</span> <span class="rating">Requires Improvement</span> · Safe: RI · Well-led: RI</div>
              <div class="mockup-row draft">
                <span class="label">Suggested opener</span>
                "Noticed your March inspection flagged care-plan record keeping. Teams
                using digital care planning typically close that gap before re-inspection…"
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pb-0">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow">The problem</span>
        <h2>Research was the bottleneck, not effort</h2>
        <p>
          SDRs at Nourish needed fast, personalised research on CQC-registered care
          providers before every call and email. The raw data existed: the Care Quality
          Commission publishes ratings and inspection reports for every registered
          provider in England. But getting to it meant manual lookups: slow,
          inconsistent between reps, and impossible to do at the volume outbound requires.
        </p>
        <p>
          The result was a familiar SDR trade-off: personalise deeply and send less, or
          send more and sound generic. I wanted to delete the trade-off.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pb-0">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow">The build</span>
        <h2>From API to first line of outreach</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-2 steps">
          {steps.map((step, i) => (
            <div class="card">
              <span class="step-num">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <h3>{step.title}</h3>
              <p>{step.body}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow">The outcome</span>
        <h2>Adopted company-wide, recognized by the CMO</h2>
        <p>
          The dashboard was adopted internally as Nourish's proof-of-concept for
          AI-assisted prospecting, used across the company, not just by me. It earned
          recognition from the CMO, who named me an <strong>"AI Champion"</strong> for
          the work.
        </p>
        <p>
          More important than the award: research that used to take minutes per provider
          now takes seconds, and every rep's outreach opens with something true and
          specific about the prospect.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="/case-studies/lead-enrichment/" class="btn btn-ghost">Next: Lead Enrichment Pipeline →</a>
          <a href="/enterprise/" class="btn btn-primary">Work with me</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .cs-hero { padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 32px; }

    .back {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .pb-0 { padding-bottom: 0; }

    .mockup-section { padding: 24px 0 0; }

    .mockup {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg-raise);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    }

    .mockup-titlebar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg-card);
    }

    .dot {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--border);
    }

    .mockup-title {
      margin-left: 10px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .mockup-body { padding: 20px; }

    .mockup-search {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .mockup-tabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .tab {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .tab.active {
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3);
    }

    .mockup-panel {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .mockup-row {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
    }

    .mockup-row .label {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .rating { color: #fbbf24; font-weight: 600; }

    .mockup-row.draft {
      border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.35);
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .steps { margin-top: 32px; }

    .step-num {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
  </style>
</Base>
